  {
   "doc": "leviathans.102",
   "kind": "review",
   "zh": "审阅注：首次接触完成或“通讯已建立”后经leviathans.101显示，正文按三家城邦之一变化；之后的外交联络经leviathans.100打开对应菜单（未被我们攻击过时）。",
   "en": "Review note: shown via leviathans.101 after first contact or 'Communications Established', worded for one of the three enclaves; later contacts open that enclave's menu through leviathans.100 (unless we attacked it)."
  },
  {
   "doc": "leviathans.157",
   "kind": "review",
   "zh": "审阅注：攻击过某商人城邦后，再联络它只会得到拒绝（157雪拉、160里甘、163穆塔根，各需对应的attacked标记）。",
   "en": "Review note: after attacking a trader enclave, contacting it only brings refusal (157 XuraCorp, 160 Riggan, 163 Muutagan, each gated by its attacked flag)."
  },
  {
   "doc": "leviathans.171",
   "kind": "review",
   "zh": "审阅注：每月检查（leviathans.170，00_on_actions.txt:93）：仍有贸易协定而能量储备耗尽时，取消所有以能量支付的协定。",
   "en": "Review note: monthly check (leviathans.170): with an active deal and no energy left, all energy-paid deals are cancelled."
  }
